-- ownership: a record of 130 lists, each a field of the parameter, stored
-- in a list. Storing it needs its deep condition (§18.2), whose 130 cells
-- fit `value-cells` (§16.7, 256). The record's construction also annotates
-- each of its paths with a container condition (#720); an annotation is no
-- allocation and no pair of the deep condition reads it, so it is not
-- counted (#763). Before, its annotations put the value at 262 entries and
-- `rebuilt` past the limit.
